body:
I think this would work and wouldn't require to access the `instantSearchInstance.client.search` internal.

```js
const searchRef = {
  current: () => {
    return Promise.resolve(
      createMultiSearchResponse(createSingleSearchResponse({ hits }))
    );
  },
};

const instantSearchInstance = instantsearch({
  searchClient: createSearchClient({
    search() {
      return searchRef.current();
    },
  }),
  indexName: 'indexName',
});

// ...

searchRef.current = () => new Promise(() => {});
```

